OL,3,GNEWSASecond murder charge after man
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder following a fatal stabbing in
OL,8,FDoncaster.
OL,10,FWayne Solomon, 57, was found seriously
OL,11,Finjured in Galsworthy Close on 24 June,
OL,12,Fand later died in hospital.
OL,14,FSouth Yorkshire Police said Carlos
OL,15,FYates, 19, of Balby Road, Doncaster,
OL,16,Fwas due to appear at Doncaster
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court later, charged with
OL,18,Fmurder and possession of a bladed
OL,19,Farticle.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
