OL,3,GNEWSASecond murder charge after man
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrandon Gilbert, 24, of no fixed abode,
OL,7,Fwas previously charged with murder and
OL,8,Fpossession of a bladed article. He has
OL,9,Fbeen remanded in custody ahead of his
OL,10,Fnext hearing at Sheffield Crown Court
OL,11,Fin January.
